        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-3",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Gambling frequency and settings"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Electronic gaming machine gambling most days, mainly at his own work venue and sometimes at a nearby club; some late-night online sports betting. Ongoing for at least 12 months and worse after COVID reopening."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-4",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-4",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Gambling preoccupation and impaired control"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports thinking about which machine is due even at dinner with his mother. Plans to spend $50 and be home by 9 pm but stays for hours and spends a few hundred dollars; reports about $1200 spent over three nights last week."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-5",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-5",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Gambling-related harms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Behind on credit card and Afterpay payments and has a small personal loan; thinks one good night will fix it. Increased conflict with his ex-partner about child support and conflict with his mother about money. Has stopped going to the gym and fishing, preferring to keep cash for gambling."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-6",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-6",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Mood"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports feeling flat and stressed in relation to gambling losses and debt. No persistent low mood or anhedonia outside the gambling context."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Suicidal thoughts and intent"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "No current suicidal ideation or plan. Occasionally thinks it would be easier to disappear, but denies intent. Daughter and close relationship with mother are protective. Assessed as no acute suicide risk today."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
