        "valueString": "Reports past psychiatric contact in his 20s after an incident at work in which he smashed a glass. Was told he had a personality disorder, described as kind of borderline; reports impulsivity and reacting strongly when people upset him. Attended some DBT groups and stopped. No current psychiatric care or medications and no past admissions."
